    <briefdescription>
<para>This is all of the cached information for one basic block. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It contains the per-value lattice elements, as well as a separate set for overdefined values to reduce memory usage. Additionally pointers dereferenced in the block are cached for nullability queries. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
